From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:47:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] sdk: pass Convex values through the typed runtime
 boundary

Add a value-argument syscall hook for database reads and writes, query terminals, nested UDFs, scheduling, metadata, authentication, storage, and function handles. Capture query operands when builders are constructed so later caller mutation cannot change the request. Expose value-returning query and mutation invocation wrappers for the Wasm adapter while retaining the existing JSON syscall and registration behavior for V8.
